<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican police shot a U.S. girl dead while pursuing a cartel, and a cartel leader accused of protecting ex-Olympian Ryan Wedding was killed in a separate incident. Kidnappings of farmers and abductions of villagers illustrate expanding cartel control over rural communities. Federal prosecutors in Georgia dismantled three cartel-linked drug trafficking rings, seized large drug shipments and sentenced two men to long federal terms. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNc3d2VFhsUzJucjhiOHdzTnBuU0VDNF9PcEV3c2VvQ2FlQ3lZM2k5VXF3TXlseFJaMDlkekVxT19GUHJvbG1VdHdfbmNRWi1MdU9zdXpGVjJCSkhXc0NOSXVseldlXzZvOU1NVlJmaFlqNUlkUkJFeHFPZ2ZIRjNkdE5vb2Ixd01LVGttWEluTTNnakkybGVtMlFfM2VHcGVqbzBFbWJWWDNFcWVTSmJGWFdmRWlVVG9tS3hpcmVtQ3Jpd04yRmdKeg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQNnJnWlVMYkUwX0hPQjVtXzZnNzhBUDhwczhNdnB0dVA3OTJnYTExdnV6ZjRya3M1UUo2TXUyT1l6U0ZRZmh2eUVRNWtJMFBDY2pMQWhaNU9yNm9NWHZGU1UzY2N1TDhwTnh1UXVNNG1YNFBWR2FWZDEzV01mMW0wS1hOcE9hZU1hbFJiaHEtZ0o2SW84T3Q4NDlOYjRTcFdPRnE2SXIzMjFQVHA3UVNZbm1ZaTF2TDhZeXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;EL PAÍS English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOLWd0amEzTExVV3R3U2lELTA5Z3ZyM1gtOFNvRmJXVHdxM2RqYUtaTWlwRDZ2SUNJcU5ydHp4NGJmWTUxclpRT3RPdFNTSEF2Y21PNUpadmJMTV9ONUhaOW5TeTZueE92ei1WWEJJZ1dzcnA3MGlLQkRlamt5WnhZN3lxZVN6QlYyd1UyaXlnNXNBOUxodUV0dA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikw